{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/title.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Rollers\u00a0</strong>is a high-speed roguelike where pinball physics meets dungeon-crawling chaos. Smash through deadly chambers, collect powerful relics, and summon legendary allies as you fight your way past bizarre monsters and colossal bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/combat.png?t=1750485661\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slam into enemies, trigger bumpers, and chain kinetic combos in tight, handcrafted pinball arenas with roguelike progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/classes.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Characters.png?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Rogue</strong> \u2013 fast, evasive, and deadly with critical strikes    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Mage</strong> \u2013 manipulative, ranged, and master of arcane summons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Knight</strong> \u2013 durable, powerful, and built for direct impact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022\u00a0<strong>More planned</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/image.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Skills.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and equip mystical weapons that alter how your ball behaves\u2014from explosive rebounds to chain lightning trails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/relics.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Healing_Room.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 stackable relics that can enhance, corrupt, or completely transform your playstyle. Synergies are key\u2014experiment or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/blacksmith.png?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Blacksmith2.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the forgebound blacksmith between runs to upgrade your arsenal, re-roll your relics, or enhance upcoming pinball chambers with new hazards, rewards, or branching effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/boss.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Boss3.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face down larger-than-life bosses in multi-stage fights. Learn their patterns, dodge their attacks, and slam them into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/summon.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Summon.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and summon spirits, creatures, and machines mid-run. Each one has unique abilities\u2014from shielding your path to unleashing devastating multi-hit attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/path.png?t=1750485661\" /></div>Navigate a branching world map full of risks, rewards, mystery shops, cursed trials, elite enemies, and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a pinball wizard or a roguelike enthusiast, <strong>Rogue Rollers</strong>\u00a0is your ticket to fast-paced arcade carnage with deep progression and devilish charm.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715690?t=1750485661","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/585ebb6ce0e461a7462ea9b9e42a94c29c7382af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750485661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/b4206b4ffa6d35ea289fd3c9d0ea792ffba34507/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750485661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/b4206b4ffa6d35ea289fd3c9d0ea792ffba34507/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750485661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/title.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Rollers\u00a0</strong>is a high-speed roguelike where pinball physics meets dungeon-crawling chaos. Smash through deadly chambers, collect powerful relics, and summon legendary allies as you fight your way past bizarre monsters and colossal bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/combat.png?t=1750485661\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slam into enemies, trigger bumpers, and chain kinetic combos in tight, handcrafted pinball arenas with roguelike progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/classes.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Characters.png?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Rogue</strong> \u2013 fast, evasive, and deadly with critical strikes    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Mage</strong> \u2013 manipulative, ranged, and master of arcane summons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022 <strong>Knight</strong> \u2013 durable, powerful, and built for direct impact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2022\u00a0<strong>More planned</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/image.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Skills.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and equip mystical weapons that alter how your ball behaves\u2014from explosive rebounds to chain lightning trails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/relics.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Healing_Room.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 stackable relics that can enhance, corrupt, or completely transform your playstyle. Synergies are key\u2014experiment or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/blacksmith.png?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Blacksmith2.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the forgebound blacksmith between runs to upgrade your arsenal, re-roll your relics, or enhance upcoming pinball chambers with new hazards, rewards, or branching effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/boss.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Boss3.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face down larger-than-life bosses in multi-stage fights. Learn their patterns, dodge their attacks, and slam them into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/summon.png?t=1750485661\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/Summon.gif?t=1750485661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and summon spirits, creatures, and machines mid-run. Each one has unique abilities\u2014from shielding your path to unleashing devastating multi-hit attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/path.png?t=1750485661\" /></div>Navigate a branching world map full of risks, rewards, mystery shops, cursed trials, elite enemies, and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a pinball wizard or a roguelike enthusiast, <strong>Rogue Rollers</strong>\u00a0is your ticket to fast-paced arcade carnage with deep progression and devilish charm.</p>","developers":["Isopod Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"